  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-30T18:58:00.164Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When interacting with VRChat's menus, it is possible to perform the pinch gesture to 'click' on the menu even while the palm of your hand is facing away from the menu towards your face. I think this is undesirable and it's also inconsistent with the Quest's universal menu.\nWith the Quest's universal menu, the pointer disappears and you can no longer 'click' on the menu if you rotate your hand around so that your palm is towards your face.\nThe behavior seen in the Quest's universal menu is preferable because it avoids the possibility of accidentally clicking on something when you're trying to perform the pinch gesture to dismiss the menu.\nVideo demonstration: \nhttps://youtu.be/3YXltKsd_AM",
